    term  go to state 41
    var   go to state 42


state 54

    2 ifthenelse_stmt: IF LPAREN expr . RPAREN LBRACE stmts RBRACE ELSE LBRACE stmts RBRACE

    RPAREN  shift, and go to state 63


state 55

    3 while_stmt: WHILE LPAREN expr . RPAREN LBRACE stmts RBRACE

    RPAREN  shift, and go to state 64


state 56

   15 stmts: stmt SEMICOLON stmts .

    $default  reduce using rule 15 (stmts)


state 57

   25 assign: var ASSIGN expr .

    $default  reduce using rule 25 (assign)


state 58

   33 term: LPAREN expr RPAREN .

    $default  reduce using rule 33 (term)


