    $default  reduce using rule 29 (expr)


state 60

   30 expr: term MINUS term .

    $default  reduce using rule 30 (expr)


state 61

   23 f_call: CALL var LPAREN args . RPAREN

    RPAREN  shift, and go to state 65


state 62

   12 args: expr . args_tail

    COMMA  shift, and go to state 66

    $default  reduce using rule 14 (args_tail)

    args_tail  go to state 67


state 63

    2 ifthenelse_stmt: IF LPAREN expr RPAREN . LBRACE stmts RBRACE ELSE LBRACE stmts RBRACE

    LBRACE  shift, and go to state 68


state 64

    3 while_stmt: WHILE LPAREN expr RPAREN . LBRACE stmts RBRACE

    LBRACE  shift, and go to state 69


